      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/benchtm/status/2026194062253117823",
      "text": "#BENCHActiveRunClub is back and we’re taking things to the next level! More hype, more hustle, and more reasons to show up and show out.\n\nTo the BENCH Active fam who joined us, thank you for bringing the fire, the focus, and the feel-good vibes!\n\nRegister here for the next session🔗 https://t.co/TlxBVHhLWp\n\n📅 March 2, 2026 (Monday) | 6PM\n📍 BENCH Flagship Store, Bonifacio Global City\n9th Avenue corner Lane O, Taguig, Metro Manila\n\nParticipants will be divided into three groups. Pick the pace that feels right for you!\n\n✅ SEXY: 8min/km Pace (3KM)\n✅ INTERMEDIATE: 7min/km Pace (5KM)\n✅ ADVANCED: 6min/km Pace (7KM)\n\nQuick tip 😉 Arrive early in your BENCH Active 'fit—you might just catch something special.\n\nSpots are limited to 100 runners per session. Register now to join the BENCH Active Run Club.\n\nJoin our Facebook group to stay updated. 🔗 https://t.co/q9ePCOrO3a\n\nSpecial thanks to Sip Plus PH and SIP Purified Water for keeping us hydrated! 💧\n\nSEE YOU THERE! 👋\n\n#BENCHActive",
